# Project Identity

This repository builds an **original mobile Godot strategy game** combining:

1. **Trial Economy Game** — settlement logistics and production chains on a hex map.
2. **Trial Military Game** — generic RTS base-building and combat (standalone trial).
3. **Hybrid Game** — economy feeds military construction and production; delegated military control.

## What This Is Not

- Not Widelands, OpenRA, Command & Conquer, or Red Alert.
- Not a clone, port, or re-skin of any reference game.
- Not a throwaway prototype — the Trial Economy Game is the permanent abstract economy engine.

## Core Principles

- Python simulation is **authoritative**; Godot is a client/viewer only.
- Test-first development with deterministic headless tests.
- All clients (human, bot, neural agent, multiplayer) use the same command pipeline.
- Use original placeholder names; avoid protected or iconic reference-game identity.

## Run Sequence

Work follows the 13-run plan in `docs/runs/`. Read the relevant run document before coding.
